flowchart TD
    A[User opens web application] --> B{Input method}
    B -->|Typed text| C[Enter message in chat box]
    B -->|Voice input| D[Browser Web Speech API converts speech to text]
    D --> C
    C --> E[JavaScript sends message to PHP api/chat.php]
    E --> F[PHP backend validates input]
    F --> G[PHP calls Python NLP processor]
    G --> H[NLTK tokenization]
    G --> I[NLTK VADER sentiment analysis]
    G --> J[spaCy keyword and entity processing]
    G --> K[Rule-based text classification]
    H --> L[Rule-based chatbot response]
    I --> L
    J --> L
    K --> L
    L --> M[PHP saves chat and NLP metadata to Supabase]
    M --> N[Return JSON response to frontend]
    N --> O[Display bot response and NLP output]
    O --> P{Speak output?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Browser Speech Synthesis API reads response aloud]
    P -->|No| R[End interaction]
    Q --> R
